J R 0~
Dryad~
a dryad~
A dryad peers at you inquisitively from behind her tree.
~
With her slim fingers she holds her tree protectively as she looks at
you, her brown eyes full of innocence and curiosity.  As you approach 
her she looks startled and disappears into the tree, only to appear on 
the other side of it moments later to smile at you shyly.  The dryad
is just slightly taller than 5 feet and has the eternally beautiful
and youthful features of the faerie folk.
~
