Nymph~
a nymph~
A nymph looks coyly at you, then winks mischeviously and dances away.
~
Her long hair is wet, as if just splashed with the waters of a crystal
brook or stream.  Her movements are full of grace and wild abandon as
she dances along the forest path.  You hear laughter like the sound of 
running water and you cannot be sure if it is her singing or a brook 
in the distance.  She calls out to you to join her in her dance.
~
