Spriggan Iachimo~
the Spriggan~
Iachimo the Dour Spriggan hides behind a tree grinning maliciously.
~
Iachimo is a spiteful prankster who often annoys the residents of the
Emerald Forest.  He sets fires at the roots of trees, poisons the 
streams and bites the pixies and brownies.  He doesn't have a good
bone in his spindly body and the forest would be well rid of him.
He unleashes a torrent of curses at you.
~
