Idiot~
the village idiot~
The village idiot is here singing to the wind.
~
This poor unfortunate fool has been left to wander around the village.
His brains are addled and he seems quite oblivious to your presence.
He is singing a song over and over again and you catch its words...
   "As I wander'd the forest
    The green leaves among
    I heard a wild flower
    Singing a song:
    I slept in the earth
    In the silent night
    I murmur'd my fears
    And I felt delight.
    In the morning I went
    As rosy as morn
    To seek for new Joy
    But I met with scorn"
~
