Knight Sorrow~
Sir Sorrow~
Sir Sorrow the sad knight stares into the sky.
~
Before you is the famed knight of the Order of the Bleeding Hearts,
Sir Sorrow. Famed fighters and honourable men, they have one nagging
trait.. all of them seem full of sorrow and sadness all year round.
It's not the sort of whining self-flagellation type insecurity or
self-pity, but a strange and deep "sorrow" which they all seem 
burdened with. The Sorrow of God, perhaps? Nobody really knows save
the members of the order.
~
