imbessar king~
Imbessar~
Imbessar the Bandit King prepares for his last duel.
~
Imbessar is a brutish giant of man. Years ago he stole the Dead Star
Circlet from the temple of Yog-Sothoth at Nag'Yrn, and has since 
crossed three worlds fleeing the vengeance of the dead god's acolytes.
Weary of the endless flight, he has chosen to make his last stand here
in the sanctuary of the Emerald Forest. As he whips about to face you,
you see that ages of paranoia and fear have moulded a defiant snarl 
permanently on his scarred face.
~
