quite happy to continue chatting merrily to her friends. Slightly
shorter than pixies, the brownies have a reputation of wit and 
cheeriness with a touch of mischief. Like most brownies, she has
pretty elvin features, and is dressed totally in brown. She wears
no cap, her otherwise long hair tied in a pony-tail.
~
