ranger lady~
a lady ranger~
A beautiful lady is talking to some animals here.
~
This woman seems (quite impossibly) to be having a conversation with
the animals of the forest! Two blue jays, a squirrel and two rabbits
are chittering and chattering and her smiles, laughter and responding
noises suggest that it is a merry conversation. Possibly elven or
half-elven, she looks about the age of a young human maid of twenty
years, her long blond hair fall gently over her shoulders making 
her strikingly beautiful.
~
